; Force public npm registry for this monorepo. Without this, a developer
; whose home ~/.npmrc routes some scopes through a private Artifactory
; mirror (e.g. JFrog) will produce a package-lock.json whose `resolved`
; URLs point at the private mirror. `npm ci` then 401s inside the
; sites-builder BuilderContainer (no Artifactory auth there), breaking
; the M4 smoke flow even for templates that depend only on public
; packages. Repo-level setting overrides home for this tree only.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
